{"availability":"available","full":"dhgefergfefruiwefhjhcduc/ML_Forgex","name":"ML_Forgex","description":"Python package for quick training, evaluation, and prediction of ML models on cleaned datasets — supports classification, regression, NLP, preprocessing, and imbalance handling.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2025-07-25T13:24:51Z","updated":"2026-07-15T12:02:42Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://dhgefergfefruiwefhjhcduc.github.io/mlforgex_documentation/","topics":[],"demo":"https://dhgefergfefruiwefhjhcduc.github.io/mlforgex_documentation/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T06:58:26.354Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T06:58:26.354Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T06:58:26.354Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T06:58:26.354Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"curated-list","name":"Awesome Machine Learning","url":"https://github.com/josephmisiti/awesome-machine-learning"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T06:58:26.354Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Automated Machine Learning utility for streamlined training, evaluation, and prediction.","Effortlessly scale your ML workflows with built-in preprocessing, hyperparameter tuning, ensembling, and an interactive dashboard.","mlforgex is a lightweight, high-performance automated machine learning (AutoML) utility designed to drastically reduce boilerplate code. Whether you're working on Regression, Classification, or Natural Language Processing (NLP) tasks, mlforgex handles everything from data cleaning and scaling to advanced hyperparameter tuning and model ensembling."],"features":["🧠 End-to-End AutoML: Automatically detects the problem type (Regression or Classification) and trains the best-in-class algorithms (XGBoost, LightGBM, CatBoost, Random Forest, etc.).","🧹 Intelligent Preprocessing: Built-in outlier removal, skewness handling, highly-correlated feature dropping, and one-hot/ordinal encoding.","⚖️ Imbalance Handling: Automatically detects and handles mild to severe class imbalances using Random Under-sampling or SMOTETomek.","📝 Native NLP Support: Processes text data natively—tokenization, stopword removal, lemmatization, and Word2Vec embeddings out-of-the-box.","🚀 Advanced Ensembles: Automatically constructs Stacking and Voting ensembles from the top-performing tuned models to maximize accuracy and minimize overfitting."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dhgefergfefruiwefhjhcduc/ML_Forgex/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d4a96a84413cbde2b7f9c9a9f2189443df6c4528bb31912a6dbea56103e5d944","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T06:58:26.354Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T06:58:26.354Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Automated Machine Learning utility for streamlined training, evaluation, and prediction.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dhgefergfefruiwefhjhcduc/ML_Forgex/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"d4a96a84413cbde2b7f9c9a9f2189443df6c4528bb31912a6dbea56103e5d944","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dhgefergfefruiwefhjhcduc/ML_Forgex/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T06:58:26.354Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-07-15T12:02:42Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dhgefergfefruiwefhjhcduc/ML_Forgex/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T06:58:26.354Z","hash":"d4a96a84413cbde2b7f9c9a9f2189443df6c4528bb31912a6dbea56103e5d944","originalBytes":6561,"storedBytes":6561,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["data","mlforgex","model","artifacts","feature","nlp","train","automatically","dashboard","interactive","models","predictions","training","classification","import","new","path","python","advanced","amazingfeature","curves","dir","documentation","git","learning","open","output","regression","target","using","automated","automl","bash","branch","built-in","commit","correlation","dashboards","data.csv","dependent","detects","ense